flowchart LR
    subgraph core [Core booking domain]
        BS[Booking service] --> BDB[(Booking DB<br/>OLTP primary)]
        BDB -->|outbox relay or CDC| K[Kafka<br/>booking-changed events]
    end
    subgraph feed [Supplier feed domain]
        K --> PJ[Projector]
        PJ --> RM[(Supplier read model<br/>per supplier, versioned,<br/>indexed by check-in date)]
        API[Supplier Booking API] --> RM
        K --> WH[Webhook notifier<br/>optional push]
    end
    SUP[Supplier system] --> GW[API gateway<br/>OAuth2 client credentials,<br/>per-supplier token bucket]
    GW --> API
    WH -.signed webhook.-> SUP
